# @slow
# Test: a customer arrives and places an order.
# The serve/drink/pay leg needs scripted player interaction
# (walk, grab, fill, hand over) which the harness cannot drive
# yet; see afterhours_gaps.md. Until then this asserts the
# spawn -> order half of the loop.
# Seeded launch: ./pharmasea.exe --e2e tests/e2e/06_customer_serve_loop.e2e --seed e2e-serve

expect_game_state InGame within 90
expect_phase night within 900
expect_entity Customer >= 1 within 300
expect_order Ordering >= 1 within 300
